:seed: intracomunitario-2026
@step Declare the intra-community obligation so the quarter is a pending filing obligation.
@setup aeat config profile edit docs-sequence-sandbox --quiet --accept-defaults --activity-start-date 2026-01-01 --does-intracomunitario
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work create --modelo 349 --year 2026 --period 1T
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work calculate --modelo 349 --year 2026 --period 1T
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work verify --modelo 349 --year 2026 --period 1T
@step After you upload at the portal, record the local filed marker in the obligation window.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work file --modelo 349 --year 2026 --period 1T
@expect result.modelo == "349"
@expect result.filing_year == 2026
@expect result.status == "vigente"
@expect result.aeat_accepted == false
@expect exit_code == 0
